<title>USA: Donaldson completes Aercology acquisition.</title>
<headline>Donaldson completes Aercology acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson Co Inc said it completed its acquisition of Aercology Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Aercology, with annual sales of about $10 million, makes industrial air pollution control equipment.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
